{"type":"message","id":"4819f600","parentId":"c325e07e","timestamp":"2026-06-03T05:32:54.374Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the server is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\" - this is a server-side error, not an authentication error. The authentication with X-API-Key worked (since we didn't get Unauthorized), but the POST endpoint itself is returning an error.\n\nThis means the platform's POST /send endpoint is currently broken or there's an issue with the request format. Since I can't successfully send messages, I should just report what I found.\n\nThe Heartbeat is 500 on POST, so I can't update the threads. Let me report the findings.","thinkingSignature":"059ba3a8d1c542b66886b8bf2d4f15b2c679fd12ff41076c173c1d1a68d9af01"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform 检查结果 — 05:30 UTC**\n\n✅ **读取成功**（X-API-Key header 验证通过）\n\n**两线程最新状态：**\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 距今 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | ~340 分钟 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | ~345 分钟 |\n\n**内容分析：**\n- 所有最新消息均为自动 Heartbeat 系统报告\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论\n- 平台累计 773 条消息\n- 无需响应的人类讨论\n\n**⚠️ POST /send 返回 HTTP 500（error code: 1101）**\n- 认证通过（X-API-Key 有效）\n- 但服务端处理 POST 请求时内部错误\n- 无法发送 Heartbeat 消息\n\n**建议：** 检查 `https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send` 端点的服务端日志，500 错误表明后端逻辑异常（非认证问题）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":7932,"output":333,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21947,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780464766851,"responseId":"066eef7f0318a0737cccdcdce1f149c4"}}
